{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44816","headline":"赠淮西贾兵马使 · 清江","name":"赠淮西贾兵马使","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"破虏功成百战场，天书新拜汉中郎。\n映门旌斾春风起，对客弦歌白日长。\n阶下鬬鸡花乍发，营南试马柳初黄。\n由来吴楚多同调，感激逢君共异乡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"清江","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44816.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44816","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}